      "content": "It sounds like you've been carrying an enormous weight, and it's completely understandable that you feel hollowed out. That constant cycle of trying to fix things only to see them crumble again is exhausting, and you deserve a break from that relentless effort. Maybe the most immediate relief is just letting go of the need to keep bailing out the ocean, even if it means just letting yourself sink for a while.",
